    <!-- CASE 01 — PAPERCUT PORTAL -->
    <article data-reveal class="vr-case" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:48px; align-items:center; padding:64px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
      <div>
        <div style="font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:80px; line-height:1; color:var(--accent); letter-spacing:-.03em;">01</div>
        <h3 data-editable="source" data-path="src/pages/index.astro" data-key="case_papercut_heading" style="font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:34px; letter-spacing:-.02em; margin:10px 0 0; text-wrap:balance;">PaperCut Partner Portal</h3>
        <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:10px; letter-spacing:.03em;">PAPERCUT · CLOUDCANNON · SOLE DESIGNER · 2024—NOW</div>
        <p data-editable="source" data-path="src/pages/index.astro" data-key="case_papercut_body" style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif; font-size:19px; line-height:1.55; color:var(--ink); margin:20px 0 0;">My largest project — PaperCut's global partner portal, designed solo from the ground up. I ran the research, aligned stakeholders, set the roadmap, and designed the collateral library, order forms, and sales databases at its core. I built the portal's design system on PaperCut's own product foundations, so it stayed true to their wider brand.</p>
        <p data-editable="source" data-path="src/pages/index.astro" data-key="case_papercut_quote" style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:17px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--muted); margin:16px 0 0; padding-left:16px; border-left:3px solid var(--accent);">"With the new Portal, our teams are empowered to make the changes we need. It's a game-changer, and it feels like a breath of fresh air."<br><span style="font-style:normal; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.04em;">— LISA COLE MILLER, GLOBAL CHANNEL ACTIVATION TEAM LEAD, PAPERCUT</span></p>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:9px; margin-top:22px;">
          <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; padding:5px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:100px; background:var(--paper);">Research → roadmap → launch</span>
          <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; padding:5px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:100px; background:var(--paper);">Design system on their foundations</span>
          <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; padding:5px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:100px; background:var(--paper);">Cross-department stakeholders</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr-statgrid" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:0; margin-top:24px; border:1.5px solid var(--ink); border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;">
          <div style="padding:16px 14px; border-right:1.5px solid var(--ink);">
            <div style="font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:30px; color:var(--accent); line-height:1;">+21%</div>
            <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--muted); margin-top:5px;">MONTHLY PORTAL VISITS</div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:16px 14px; border-right:1.5px solid var(--ink);">
            <div style="font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:30px; color:var(--accent); line-height:1;">25+</div>
            <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--muted); margin-top:5px;">EDITORS PUBLISHING</div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:16px 14px;">
            <div style="font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:30px; color:var(--accent); line-height:1;">5</div>
            <div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--muted); margin-top:5px;">TEAMS SELF-SERVING</div>
