          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:19px; line-height:1.5; margin:0; color:var(--ink);">"As a colourblind non-designer who has to create assets, having such a range to choose from and adapt (and with a preset colour palette) has been a huge timesaver. They let me stick to our approved brand style while injecting a little personality into each image I create."</p>
          <footer style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.05em; color:var(--muted); margin-top:14px;">DAVID LARGE — CONTENT SPECIALIST, CLOUDCANNON</footer>
